[l_english.MODULE_ARMOR_4B_MAGNET]
Energy Shield

[l_english.MODULE_ARMOR_4B_MAGNET_desc]
I understand why electromagnetic force can deflect bullets and even lasers, but how does your electromagnetic shield block cheese and pumpkins?

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ARMOR_4B_MAGNET]
能量护盾

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ARMOR_4B_MAGNET_desc]
我理解为什么电磁力可以偏转炮弹甚至激光，但是你的电磁力护盾是怎么挡住奶酪和南瓜的？
